msgid "\"Based on my experience, I was hoping for something closer to [X].\""
msgstr "\"Based on my experience, I was hoping for something closer to [X].\""

msgid "\"Based on my research and experience, I'm looking for something in the range of [X] to [Y]. I'm open to discussing how the full package fits together.\""
msgstr "\"Based on my research and experience, I'm looking for something in the range of [X] to [Y]. I'm open to discussing how the full package fits together.\""

msgid "\"I'm very excited about this role. Can we discuss the compensation?\""
msgstr "\"I'm very excited about this role. Can we discuss the compensation?\""

msgid "\"Is there any flexibility in the package?\""
msgstr "\"Is there any flexibility in the package?\""

msgid "\"What does the typical career path look like here?\""
msgstr "\"What does the typical career path look like here?\""

msgid "1. Research Your Market Value"
msgstr "1. Research Your Market Value"

msgid "2. Give a Range, Not a Fixed Number"
msgstr "2. Give a Range, Not a Fixed Number"

msgid "3. Think Beyond the Base Salary"
msgstr "3. Think Beyond the Base Salary"

msgid "4. How to Handle the Conversation"
msgstr "4. How to Handle the Conversation"

msgid "5. Knowing When to Accept"
msgstr "5. Knowing When to Accept"

msgid "6. Negotiation Checklist"
msgstr "6. Negotiation Checklist"

msgid "Accepting on the spot under pressure — ask for time."
msgstr "Accepting on the spot under pressure — ask for time."

msgid "Annual bonus or performance incentive."
msgstr "Annual bonus or performance incentive."

msgid "Ask if the role has a formal review after 3–6 months."
msgstr "Ask if the role has a formal review after 3–6 months."

msgid "Be ready to justify why you sit at the higher end."
msgstr "Be ready to justify why you sit at the higher end."

msgid "Before any negotiation, know what people in similar roles earn in your region. Walking in with data gives you credibility."
msgstr "Before any negotiation, know what people in similar roles earn in your region. Walking in with data gives you credibility."

msgid "Benefits are unclear or non-existent."
msgstr "Benefits are unclear or non-existent."

msgid "Benefits meaningfully compensate for any salary gap."
msgstr "Benefits meaningfully compensate for any salary gap."

msgid "Career Advice"
msgstr "Career Advice"

msgid "Clear on what would make you decline the offer."
msgstr "Clear on what would make you decline the offer."

msgid "Clear path for growth and pay increases."
msgstr "Clear path for growth and pay increases."

msgid "Colleagues or contacts in similar roles."
msgstr "Colleagues or contacts in similar roles."

msgid "Common Extras to Consider"
msgstr "Common Extras to Consider"

msgid "Company size — larger companies often pay more."
msgstr "Company size — larger companies often pay more."

msgid "Confirm what triggers a pay increase in the future."
msgstr "Confirm what triggers a pay increase in the future."

msgid "Defined your target salary and absolute minimum."
msgstr "Defined your target salary and absolute minimum."

msgid "Employer is dismissive of any negotiation attempt."
msgstr "Employer is dismissive of any negotiation attempt."

msgid "Example phrase:"
msgstr "Example phrase:"

msgid "Extra vacation days beyond the legal minimum."
msgstr "Extra vacation days beyond the legal minimum."

msgid "Flexible working hours or hybrid/remote options."
msgstr "Flexible working hours or hybrid/remote options."

msgid "Giving an ultimatum unless you mean it."
msgstr "Giving an ultimatum unless you mean it."

msgid "Health or dental coverage."
msgstr "Health or dental coverage."

msgid "How to Negotiate Your Salary with Confidence"
msgstr "How to Negotiate Your Salary with Confidence"

msgid "How to Set Your Range"
msgstr "How to Set Your Range"

msgid "If asked about your current salary, redirect: \"I'd prefer to focus on what this role offers and what's fair for the responsibilities involved.\""
msgstr "If asked about your current salary, redirect: \"I'd prefer to focus on what this role offers and what's fair for the responsibilities involved.\""

msgid "Industry associations and professional networks."
msgstr "Industry associations and professional networks."

msgid "Job listings that show salary ranges."
msgstr "Job listings that show salary ranges."

msgid "Keep the top end realistic — 10–15% above the bottom."
msgstr "Keep the top end realistic — 10–15% above the bottom."

msgid "Leaves flexibility without appearing inflexible."
msgstr "Leaves flexibility without appearing inflexible."

msgid "Listed the benefits and perks that matter most to you."
msgstr "Listed the benefits and perks that matter most to you."

msgid "Making it personal or emotional."
msgstr "Making it personal or emotional."

msgid "Naming a single number puts you at a disadvantage. A well-anchored range gives you room to negotiate while signalling your expectations."
msgstr "Naming a single number puts you at a disadvantage. A well-anchored range gives you room to negotiate while signalling your expectations."

msgid "Negotiate a sign-on bonus instead."
msgstr "Negotiate a sign-on bonus instead."

msgid "Never start below what you'd actually accept."
msgstr "Never start below what you'd actually accept."

msgid "Not every negotiation ends at your target. Know your boundaries and how to make a decision you're comfortable with."
msgstr "Not every negotiation ends at your target. Know your boundaries and how to make a decision you're comfortable with."

msgid "Offer is significantly below market rate with no room to move."
msgstr "Offer is significantly below market rate with no room to move."

msgid "Phrases That Work"
msgstr "Phrases That Work"

msgid "Practised how to respond to common counter-questions."
msgstr "Practised how to respond to common counter-questions."

msgid "Prepared a realistic range with your target at the low end."
msgstr "Prepared a realistic range with your target at the low end."

msgid "Prepared to redirect questions about current salary."
msgstr "Prepared to redirect questions about current salary."

msgid "Pressure to decide immediately without time to think."
msgstr "Pressure to decide immediately without time to think."

msgid "Put your target salary at the lower end of the range."
msgstr "Put your target salary at the lower end of the range."

msgid "Ready to ask for time before accepting a final offer."
msgstr "Ready to ask for time before accepting a final offer."

msgid "Reduces the risk of pricing yourself out early."
msgstr "Reduces the risk of pricing yourself out early."

msgid "Regional cost of living and local demand."
msgstr "Regional cost of living and local demand."

msgid "Request additional leave or a flexible schedule."
msgstr "Request additional leave or a flexible schedule."

msgid "Researched salary benchmarks for your role and location."
msgstr "Researched salary benchmarks for your role and location."

msgid "Revealing your current or previous salary first."
msgstr "Revealing your current or previous salary first."

msgid "Role aligns with your long-term career goals."
msgstr "Role aligns with your long-term career goals."

msgid "Salary comparison websites (Glassdoor, Payscale, LinkedIn)."
msgstr "Salary comparison websites (Glassdoor, Payscale, LinkedIn)."

msgid "Salary is at or close to your target range."
msgstr "Salary is at or close to your target range."

msgid "Salary negotiation is a normal part of the hiring process. Learn how to research your worth, frame your ask, and reach an agreement that works for both you and your employer — across any industry."
msgstr "Salary negotiation is a normal part of the hiring process. Learn how to research your worth, frame your ask, and reach an agreement that works for both you and your employer — across any industry."

msgid "Salary ranges for your job title and industry."
msgstr "Salary ranges for your job title and industry."

msgid "Shows you've done your homework."
msgstr "Shows you've done your homework."

msgid "Signs It's a Good Deal"
msgstr "Signs It's a Good Deal"

msgid "Signs to Reconsider"
msgstr "Signs to Reconsider"

msgid "The way you negotiate matters as much as the number you propose. Stay professional, positive, and collaborative."
msgstr "The way you negotiate matters as much as the number you propose. Stay professional, positive, and collaborative."

msgid "Tip:"
msgstr "Tip:"

msgid "Total compensation includes more than monthly pay. Understanding the full package lets you negotiate more effectively."
msgstr "Total compensation includes more than monthly pay. Understanding the full package lets you negotiate more effectively."

msgid "Training budget or professional development."
msgstr "Training budget or professional development."

msgid "Transport allowance or parking."
msgstr "Transport allowance or parking."

msgid "What to Avoid"
msgstr "What to Avoid"

msgid "What to Research"
msgstr "What to Research"

msgid "When the Salary Is Fixed"
msgstr "When the Salary Is Fixed"

msgid "Where to Look"
msgstr "Where to Look"

msgid "Why a Range Works"
msgstr "Why a Range Works"

msgid "Your floor becomes the employer's ceiling — set it right."
msgstr "Your floor becomes the employer's ceiling — set it right."

msgid "Your years of experience vs. the role's requirements."
msgstr "Your years of experience vs. the role's requirements."
